    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for learning, but I’ve used data analysis tools (like Python libraries) to visualize physics equations or solve optimization problems for my research. The structured output helped me verify results quickly—though I still prefer hands-on practice.",
